#########################
### Rebel Ship Models ###
#########################


#	Model					Section												Built-In Locators

#	Mercy				-	Colony Ship										-	Engines + Explosions
#	Y8				-	Construction Ship									-	Engines + Explosions
#	GR75				-	Transport Ship										-	Engines + Explosions
#	CR90 Science			-	Science Ship										-	Engines + Explosions
#	CR90				-	Corvette S3 + Corvette M1S1								-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	CR90H				-	Add-On Corvette S1HB									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	DP20				-	Add-On Corvette M1S1 01									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Sphyrna				-	Add-On Corvette M1S1 02									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	MC12				-	Destroyer Stern S2									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Marauder Cruiser		-	Destroyer Stern M1									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Nebulon-B			-	Cruiser Mid M2S2									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Nebulon-C			-	Cruiser Mid L1M1									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Nebulon Widow			-	Exploration Cruiser Bow L1 + Exploration Cruiser Bow M2					-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Nebulon Ranger			-	Exploration Cruiser Bow M1S2								-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Quasar Fire			-	Add-On Cruiser Mid S2HB 01								-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	KDY Strike Cruiser		-	Add-On Cruiser Mid S2HB 02								-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	MC30				-	Cruiser Mid M2S2 + Cruiser Mid S2HB							-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	MC40				-	Add-On Cruiser Mid M2S2									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Assault Frigate Mk.I		-	Battlecruiser Bow M1S2									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Assault Frigate Mk.I Twin-Wing	-	Battlecruiser Bow M2									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Assault Frigate Mk.II		-	Battlecruiser Bow L1									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Nebula Star Destroyer		-	Battleship Mid Mid L3									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Valiant Star Destroyer		-	Battleship Mid M4SHB									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	MC75 Profundity			-	Battleship Mid L2M2 + Battleship Mid S4LHB						-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	MC80 Liberty			-	Dreadnought Bow L1M1S2 + Dreadnought Bow M1S2SHB					-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	MC80				-	Dreadnought Bow L2 + Dreadnought Bow XL1						-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Mediator Battlecruiser		-	Carrier Bow L1M1S2 + Carrier Bow L2 + Carrier Bow M1S2SHB + Carrier Bow XL1		-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	MC55				-	Juggernaut										-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions (& Detonate)
#	MC102				-	Coloussus										-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions (& Detonate)
#	MC80 Home One			-	Titan Mid										-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions (& Detonate)
#	Viscount Star Defender		-	Flagship Bow L1M1S2 + Flagship Bow L2 + Flagship Bow M1S2SHB + Flagship Bow XL1		-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions (& Detonate)


